      "text": "Shares concurrent logout calls, waits for any pending user/refresh request to finish\n(ignoring its failure), then POSTs /auth/logout with cookies. Throws on non-success and\nclears logoutRequest in finally.",
      "originalText": "Shares concurrent logout calls, waits for any pending user/refresh request to finish\n(ignoring its failure), then POSTs /auth/logout with cookies. Throws on non-success and\nclears logoutRequest in finally.",
