      "text": "Owns active/error/preview state and recorder/stream/timer refs. Mount cleanup stops\ncapture, clears timeout, and marks component unmounted; preview effect revokes replaced\nobject URLs. Its media-event callbacks assemble the File.",
      "originalText": "Owns active/error/preview state and recorder/stream/timer refs. Mount cleanup stops\ncapture, clears timeout, and marks component unmounted; preview effect revokes replaced\nobject URLs. Its media-event callbacks assemble the File.",
