      "text": "Owns selected file, language, saved job, job ID, recording/pending state, limits, and\nfeedback. Its mount effect loads server limits; failure is ignored because the server\nstill enforces limits. Forms delegate to upload, lookup, and download handlers.",
      "originalText": "Owns selected file, language, saved job, job ID, recording/pending state, limits, and\nfeedback. Its mount effect loads server limits; failure is ignored because the server\nstill enforces limits. Forms delegate to upload, lookup, and download handlers.",
